terraform_module_snippets:
Example module interface (customer overlay):

module "otel_collector" {
  source = "git::ssh://git@github.com/redwood-inference/terraform-modules.git//modules/otel-collector?ref=v0.3.0"
  cluster_name = var.cluster_name
  mode = var.otel_mode // \"daemonset\" or \"deployment\"
  config_template = file("../templates/otel-default.yaml.tpl")
  remote_write_prometheus = module.prometheus.remote_write_endpoint
  secret_refs = { api_key = var.api_key_ref }
}

Keep overlays small; prefer passing a single config_template instead of building huge variables list.
